<title>UK: Storehouse down as Kleinwort rates &quot;sell&quot;.</title>
<headline>Storehouse down as Kleinwort rates &quot;sell&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Storehouse Plc dropped on Tuesday as analysts at Kleinwort Benson issued a &quot;sell&quot; note on the retail stock, market sources said.</p>
<p>Storehouse shares, which set a four-month high of 306p on February 12, were down 2-1/2p at 289 by 1030 GMT in thin volume of 181,617 shares.</p>
<p>Anaysts at Kleinwort were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
